      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_Susana%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The nearby Corriganville Movie Ranch turned into a Western film set in the 1930s and 1940s, hosting shows like Gunsmoke and Bonanza.",
